---
title: "Request a Nowhere tip or donation invoice"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Checking the amount
  s1: Invoice request failed
  s2: Selecting a payment method
  s3: Getting the provider amount limits
  s4: Ready to request an invoice
  s5: Waiting for the provider response
  s6: Invoice available
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: reject the amount
  s0 --> s2: accept a positive whole-sat amount
  s2 --> s1: reject missing or unsupported method
  s2 --> s3: select Lightning
  s3 --> s1: report a provider or response error or reject amount outside provider limits
  s3 --> s4: accept amount within provider limits
  s4 --> s5: send invoice request
  s5 --> s6: return the invoice
  s5 --> s1: report a provider or response error
